携带；传播；散开；传开；粘附；贴住；粘上；附上</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195969\">ほら、あなたの<ruby>乗<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る<ruby>電車<rp>(</rp><rt>でんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たわ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Look, here comes your train.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ノート</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">笔记本；练习本；作业本；笔记；记录；（音乐）音符；笔记本电脑；便携式电脑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217911\">これらの<ruby>語<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をノートに<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Write these words in your notebook.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">歯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">は</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">牙齿；牙；齿；齿（梳子、锯子等的）；木屐的齿（支撑底部的突起）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208598\">その<ruby>赤<rp>(</rp><rt>あか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちゃんは<ruby>歯<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>生<rp>(</rp><rt>は</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えはじめている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The baby is cutting his teeth.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">はい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m